{"ASK_RADIO","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"The emergency broadcast, the tone, the message, over and over","They keep saying \"stay tuned\""},false,false,{[2]={{t="so I stay tuned",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,14",{"It's mostly static now, a few survivors broadcasting","The official channel went off on the fifth"},false,false,{[2]={{t="I miss it",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=15,99999",{"Mostly voices of people like us","The old stations are dead"},false,false,{[1]={{t="reading names, praying, selling",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="the new ones are strangers",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Radio? I turned it off the first day, noise draws them, and I'm not interested in company","Heard a loop saying \"remain calm, stay in your homes\", I laughed so hard I cried","Some guy reads names off a list every few hours, I never listen, I don't want to hear mine","I smash radios, they make noise, they give away positions, they never say anything useful","Nothing on it but static and the occasional crazy person, and sometimes I am the crazy person","My boys use radios to find easy marks, funny how it works both ways"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Don't ask me about radios, I broke the last one on a guy's head"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"I listen every night, hoping for a voice, any voice, just to hear somebody who isn't screaming","Yeah, there's one station, a woman, she keeps reading the same warning, I know it by heart now"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","role=raider_boss,gang_boss,biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"I keep a radio on for information, and I don't discuss what I learn"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Radio? Man, all I get is static and some old preacher yelling about hell","Used to listen to the station every night, now it's emergency broadcasts, the same one over and over","Batteries ran out, now it's just a paperweight","We hear the Army on it sometimes, talking in code, can't make sense of it"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Radio's for snitches, you a snitch?"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I miss music, {g:man|lady}, I'd kill for one song on the radio, just one"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"CB's the only thing that works, old truckers talking, mostly rumors","Radio's got a loop about the quarantine, over and over, I could recite it","We keep one on the shelf, hardly use it, no one's saying anything worth hearing","Heard a guy on CB yesterday, said he was in Radcliff, begging for help, then nothing"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Stay away from our radio, you hear me?"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Anything useful on the dial, {g:brother|sister}, I'd love to know"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I monitor several frequencies, for business purposes","It's mostly noise, but occasionally one learns something","Emergency Broadcast System is looping, nothing new, nothing helpful","Police scanner went silent day three, that told me more than the broadcast did"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"If I hear something worth sharing, I'll pass it along"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Radio? We had one in the yard, now I don't want to hear anything, ever","Voices in the dark, that's all it is, and I've had enough voices for one lifetime","Keep it low if you turn it on. I'd like to hear anything else coming"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Turn it off! Turn it off!"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"I'd listen to anything just to not feel alone"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Battery-powered, only on at night, low volume, I don't need anyone finding me","Couple of stations still running, one's religious, one's the government, and neither's helping","I listen for gunfire more than voices, it tells me where not to go"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Try 1610 AM, there's a voice that sounds almost human"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"Radio was how they gave us orders, and I don't ever want to hear that again"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Dispatch frequency went quiet on day three, we're monitoring other channels","We pick up the EBS, loops, nothing local","The scanner is our only link, and it's mostly static"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Radio communications are restricted, please stay off the air"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=law|st=friendly",{"If you hear anything on yours, let me know, anything at all"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"I've been trying to raise the state for four days, nothing"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Can't talk about the radio, move along","Communications are restricted to authorized personnel","Channel's been quiet since oh-six-hundred"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Do not touch the radio, that is an order"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=military|st=friendly",{"We're monitoring, that's all I can say, but I'll tell you if I hear something"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","role=soldier_nco|st=neutral,careful",{"Keep the chatter off the net, soldier, unless you got something to report"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"I tried calling my mom on the unit's radio, they yelled at me... I just wanted to say I'm alive"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=elite|st=neutral,careful",{"Radio is a liability, we don't use it unless necessary"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"I use mine for work, not for company"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"We listen for the preacher in the evenings, he reads scripture, it helps the kids","Got a ham radio from my uncle, picks up all kinds of folks, mostly scared","Batteries are precious, so only an hour at dusk"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Come by and listen, it's company, if nothing else"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=3,9999",{"There's a station on 99.6 FM, somebody broadcasting right here in Knox County - they read names sometimes, I listen for my boy's"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,6",{"The emergency broadcast keeps saying stay inside and wait for instructions - it's been saying that since Friday"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle",{"Daddy's got a CB in the truck, channel 19 was nothing but crying the first night - we turned it off"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I found a Walkman with a radio in it, I only turn it on at night so the batteries last - it's company"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral|day=5,9999",{"Try 99.6 FM - Knox County Radio Channel, fella on there doesn't know much, but he's honest about it"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Radio's mostly static and preachers, once in a while somebody reads off a trade - that part's worth waiting for"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Keep the volume low, a radio carries farther than you think, and they hear it just fine"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=civilian,family,worker|st=friendly,neutral|day=11,9999",{"Army frequencies went quiet around day ten, now it's just us talking to us"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Radio says leave strangers alone, I'm listening to it"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Dispatch channel at the plant still clicks every morning at six - nobody on it, just the timer, I guess","Scanner in my truck grabs the Army net now and then - they talk in letters and numbers, they don't sound happy"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=rescue|role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Our fire band is dead, I leave it on anyway, if anybody from Station 2 comes on, I want to be here to answer"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=rescue|role=rescue_medical,rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral|day=6,9999",{"A nurse called in to the Knox County Radio Channel on 99.6 with wound care tips - better than nothing, most days better than me"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral|day=5,9999",{"County channel still keys up once in a while, I hear somebody ask for a 10-20 and nobody answers - I quit answering it myself"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral|day=5,9999",{"Try the Knox County Radio Channel, 99.6 FM, it's not official, but it's more accurate than we ever were"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=law|role=law_deputy,law_sheriff,law_sergeant|st=friendly,neutral",{"Got a portable on the sheriff's band, battery lasts about four hours - I spend them listening for my own unit number"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"Radio's for official traffic, you're not official - move along"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral",{"Not permitted to share net frequencies - try the civilian FM band, there's a local station on 99.6","Say again? You want a frequency? Negative, civilian band's all you get"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=elite",{"Net frequencies are restricted - don't transmit near us"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=military,elite|st=careful,hostile",{"If you've got a radio, keep it off, transmitting near this position gets you shot"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=outlaw,raider,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Radio's how you find people, people with stuff, you keep yours on, {mister}"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=crime,outlaw|st=friendly,neutral|day=5,9999",{"Guy on 99.6 reads out trades, and somebody always says where they're holding - people are real trusting"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=gang,club|st=friendly,neutral",{"We listen to the Army channel for laughs, they don't know where anything is either"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"Only thing on the radio is how nobody's coming - real comforting for you, huh?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Radio won't hear you scream - keep your hands off that bag"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"There's a fella broadcasting at night, he takes calls - only voice I've got left"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=family|st=neutral|mood=warm",{"We run the radio one hour a night to save batteries - the kids pick the hour"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral,friendly|world=road",{"CB beats FM right now, nineteen for the road, nine if you're in real trouble"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","role=rescue_medical|st=neutral",{"There was a medical frequency to monitor, it's been carrier hum for a week"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","role=rescue_clergy|st=neutral|mood=sad",{"A man reads names on the air some nights - just names, best thing on the dial"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"Emergency broadcast ran the same loop two days and then went to nothing"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"Our repeater's still up, ain't nobody on it but me and a whole lot of static"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Military nets are scrambled and you won't hear them - don't waste batteries hunting"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","role=elite_delta|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Mostly just listen on it, every time you transmit you give away where you are"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=club|st=neutral",{"Scanner in the shop picks up everything, most of it's folks asking if anybody's there"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","role=crime_member|st=neutral",{"Batteries are the new money, I'd swap a radio for a case of D cells any day"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","role=civilian_loner|st=careful|mood=grim",{"I heard my own words come back at me on nineteen once - wasn't an echo, either"}},
{"ASK_RADIO","reg=raider,gang|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"We listen, y'all say your positions right out loud on nineteen - thanks for that"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian|st=friendly,neutral",{"They took everything from the house on Elm, left a note - written in lipstick"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"They came at night, we hid in the cellar and held our breath"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle",{"The gang at the truck stop - stay clear of them","Men took the fuel truck from the co-op at gunpoint - knew exactly which one was full, somebody told them"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"They don't touch the clinic - not yet - don't test it"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral",{"Armed crews out on Highway 31, we've lost two units to them","Any roadblock that isn't marked, steer clear, that's not us and it's not the Guard"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hostile groups in the northeast - avoid"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hostiles are active in the sector - keep clear","Armed civilians hitting convoys, we treat any unmarked roadblock as hostile"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Known threats - avoid"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=outlaw|st=friendly,neutral",{"Plenty of them, plenty worse than me"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=raider|st=friendly,neutral",{"Raiders? Never heard of them - Hah"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral",{"Everyone's raiding - ask a specific crew"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral|world=water,road",{"Bunch on the river road took one of ours"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Several groups, all on the same market","Couple of crews out there, we ain't one of 'em - we're more of a service industry"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hell, I'm one of them, but not by choice","Some of the guys I came out with, I don't run with them anymore, they like it too much"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Raiders? there are raiders? oh no, what do they do? what do they WANT?","Yes, I've heard of them, bad people, nobody wants to meet them, they take everything","A man told me about a group, they've got trucks and guns and no mercy, I don't know where","Be careful, please, THERE are people worse than the dead, I wish that weren't true!","Never met any, thank God, I hear they wear masks or paint their faces or something","They hit a farm a few miles off, took everything, even the dog, I can't talk about it"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Plenty, some call themselves militias, some call themselves gangs, they're all the same","Folks out on the highways, folks who figured out stealing is easier than scavenging","Avoid anyone with more guns than sense, and anyone with too much food","They'll smile first, then rob you, or rob you first, then smile, depends on the day","Gangs from the city, Louisville mostly, came out here when the food ran out","Biker types, a pack of 'em, loud, mean, armed, stay clear"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Watch your back, and I'll watch mine, deal? there's a bad bunch out there","I can't tell you who's who. Don't take somebody's word for it just because they smile at you","Stick with me, and we'll keep out of their way"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"You're asking me? you tell me, are YOU a raider?","Don't ask questions you don't want answered","Ask them yourself","Why? you asking for yourself?","I don't talk about them","You tell me","They're around!","How do I know you're not one of them? Stay back there","People asking about raiders are usually scouting for them - which are you?"},false,{[9]="GENERIC"},{[7]={{t="and you look like one",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=civilian_loner",{"Crews of five or six, working the roads, they stop travelers, take their packs, sometimes their boots","Saw smoke from a camp I used to use, now there's a flag, and men with rifles, I moved on"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=militia",{"Armed groups, hostile, answer to nobody, we watch 'em and hit back if they come close"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=family_man,family_woman",{"Folks with guns and no conscience, so I keep my guard up and a prayer in my heart"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"You didn't hear this from me, but there's a gang on the east road, ten or twelve, well armed","They hit a farm last week, took everything, left the family alive, which is more than most","Watch for men in matching jackets, they travel in a pack, polite at first, then not","There's a rumor of a crew that's recruiting, forcing people to join, avoid them","They have a signal -- a whistle, two short, one long, if you hear it, hide!","If somebody offers you a ride, say no, that's how they got my neighbor!","A bunch of ex-cons, I heard, who broke out of the county jail","They're led by a man with a limp, mean as a snake, don't look him in the eye!","They like to take your boots first, then your pack, then your name","I know someone they robbed, he still hasn't stopped shaking","Keep your valuables close, and your valuables hidden, there's a difference","They avoid daylight, mostly, so travel by day","There's a trail of burned barns marking where they've been","Two women ran from them last week, they said the leader has a scar on his cheek","Stay clear of the quarry, they use it as a hideout, I'm told","I'd walk you out of town -- but I'd draw attention, so just go quietly","They speak softly -- smile a lot, and steal everything not bolted down","My cousin got away from them, with a broken wrist","If you see a truck with no lights, run!","Some of 'em don't even carry a gun, they just wait you out","They've been seen at dusk, along the creek, like wolves","Those people have no rules, and no mercy","They look like anyone else, which is the scariest part","A little girl told me they sing while they work, a happy song, it gives me chills","Rumor is they're moving, heading this way","Their leader used to be a deputy, can you believe it?","They take hostages, so, don't wander alone","A pack of dogs follows them, big ones","Keep a weapon close, and a plan closer","Someone's got to stop them, and I wish it were me"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"Raiders? You'd know more than I do","Funny, you ask me about raiders","Look in the mirror","You don't need directions, you need a conscience!","Everyone's wondering whose side you're on","I won't help you find your friends!","Why? Are you looking for your crew?","There are no raiders here, except you","If I knew, I wouldn't tell you","You tell me, you seem to be the expert","Some people say you're one of them","Ask the ones in the ditch!","Not my business, not yours","I'm not discussing them with you","Raiders? Can't say I've heard of any","I won't be your informant","Find them yourself, you've got the right smell","It takes one to know one!!","They'd probably welcome you","I stay out of that business","Ask the sheriff, if there's a sheriff","We have a few, and they all look like you","Try the quarry, the creek, the road, anywhere you like","Don't make me say it!","I don't talk to people who might be spies","You have no right to ask","I wouldn't tell you where they are, even for a million dollars","Keep digging, you'll find them","If you see them, say hello for me","I'm not afraid to say no"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Raiders? Those are people, these are monsters, I'm more worried about these","Raiders will keep -- these won't","At the moment, the dead are worse than the living!"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=player_armed",{"You look like you could take on a raider or two"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_human_contact",{"Raiders? Maybe... I heard voices, there could be some around","I just saw strangers, I don't know who they were"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"They come at dusk, when you're tired","A man with a smile and a shotgun is a scary thing","I met some on the road","They don't take everything","You can tell by the way they walk","I saw a farm they hit","Raiders aren't the worst part","They have rules","Stay quiet when they pass","They took a girl from the church group.."},false,false,{[1]={{t="they smile first",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="they were polite",afterMs=3200},{t="they took my boots anyway",afterMs=2800}},[4]={{t="they leave just enough that you can't hate them properly",afterMs=3500}},[5]={{t="loose, easy, like they own the road",afterMs=3200}},[6]={{t="the dogs were still tied up",afterMs=3500},{t="I untied them",afterMs=3000}},[7]={{t="the worst part is that some of them were neighbors",afterMs=3200}},[8]={{t="that's the creepy thing",afterMs=3500},{t="very polite rules",afterMs=3000}},[9]={{t="they'll pass, sometimes",afterMs=3200}},[10]={{t="we haven't heard",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"Raiders? Oh, I've seen worse at the church bake sale","Raiders? They'd starve at my house, I've got nothing but rice"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"They took everything... my cow, my garden, my husband's tools...","They were boys, mostly"},false,false,{[1]={{t="and then they took him..",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="somebody's sons",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"Raiders?! Cowards, thieves, scum, I'd like five minutes alone with each of them","They'll pay for what they did, if THERE's a God, they'll pay!"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"If they come I'm standing with you, you and me and everybody here"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Raiders? Never heard of them, ha, you're looking at the nicest guy in the county","If you see them, you won't be talking about it for long","Dangerous people, plenty of them, and none of them like being asked about","There's raiders and there's raiders, and I'm the second kind, the kind you want to avoid","Why, you looking for them? Or are you running from them?"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Who's dangerous? Me, you idiot, right now!"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Everyone's dangerous, but there are worse than me, trust that much"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=raider_boss,gang_boss,biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"There are people who take what they want, and there are people who stop them, you're about to find out which I am"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Raiders? Man, there's crews out there, taking whatever, I don't mess with them","Stay away from the east side, that's all I'll say","We keep our distance, they keep theirs, uneasy truce","Some people are more dangerous than the dead, you know what I'm saying?"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Why, you looking for a fight? Because I'm happy to oblige"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Watch out for guys with rifles on the overpass, they're not friendly"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Plenty of those around, {g:brother|sister}, mostly deserters and looters","I'd avoid anybody with more than two weapons and no friends","We've had a few run-ins, most ended badly for them"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Keep asking and you'll find out who's dangerous"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Be careful with strangers on the road, even ones who smile"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Some people look at all this and see a payday, that's all","Opportunists, yes, I know several personally","I'd avoid anyone offering protection, they're usually the threat"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Be cautious, friend, I've seen what they do"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Raiders? Everybody's a raider now, including me, sorry","Stay away from groups of men with matching jackets","Don't tell anybody where you sleep, that's how they find you"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"I'm nobody's raider, I just want to be left alone!"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"I was almost caught by a gang last week, ran for hours"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Heard about a crew near the quarry, took everything from a family","Folks around here call them wolves, and they've earned it","Stay off the back roads after dark, that's their hunting ground"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"If you meet them, don't resist, just give them what they want and walk away"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"Some of the men from my unit went bad, I'm not proud of that"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"We've received multiple reports of armed groups engaged in robbery and assault","Deputies are working to identify them, but our resources are limited","If you encounter armed individuals, do not confront them","Several have been seen near the highway, we're trying to track them"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Are you reporting a crime? If not, move along"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=law|st=friendly",{"We're doing everything we can to stop them, you can help by telling us what you've seen"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"I know the ones causing trouble, and I intend to stop them"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"We have reports of armed civilians engaged in looting","Avoid armed groups, return to your location"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Armed civilians will be treated as hostile"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=military|st=friendly",{"If you've seen any, let us know, we'll take care of it"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=soldier_nco|st=neutral,careful",{"Some of the worst men I've ever met are wearing civilian clothes now"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"I don't want to meet them, I really don't, I'm terrified of everyone with a gun"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=elite|st=neutral,careful",{"I deal with them, you don't need to"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"Where there's chaos, there's profit, I'm sure they've noticed"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"There's a crew that hit the Johnson place last week, took everything","We post guards every night, watch for strangers, anyone armed is trouble","Not from around here, that's for sure, no local'd do that"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=militia|st=friendly",{"If you see anything, come tell us, we'll take care of it together"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle,building",{"A truck full of men took everything off the Millers' porch while they watched - didn't even hurry"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|sex=f",{"Some men came by asking about my husband's guns, I said we didn't have any, I don't think they believed me"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"Yes, they killed my friend - I don't want to say who, just stay off the county roads in the evening"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly|world=cars",{"There's men in painted trucks going house to house, if you could do anything about them... would you help us?"},false,{[1]="HELP_THEM"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"Road crews on 31W, they lay out spike strips and wait - don't drive at night"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Bad people, same as always, just nobody stopping them now - the ones who smile are the worst"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Bunch of escapees came down from the prison, orange pants cut off into shorts, you'll know them"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family|st=friendly,neutral|day=8,9999|world=door",{"There's a crew stripping houses from West Point to Muldraugh - they spray-paint a mark on the doors they've hit"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Could be you, for all I know - get going"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=rescue|role=rescue_medical,rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"They shot up our ambulance for the drugs, we don't keep drugs in it anymore - we don't advertise that"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=rescue|role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"Men came for the church pantry, I gave them half and asked them to leave the rest for the children - they took it all"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"At least two organized armed groups in the county, I'd call them what they are - robbers"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=law|role=law_corrections,law_deputy,law_sheriff,law_trooper|st=friendly,neutral",{"There's escapees loose from the prison, some were in there for good reason - tell me if you see them"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"I'm not briefing you, for all I know you're running with them - hands where I can see them"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=military|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral|world=water",{"Hostile groups working near the river, we don't have the manpower to go after them"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=elite",{"Armed groups present, known locations tracked, not your problem unless you make it one"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=military|st=careful,hostile",{"Anybody armed and unidentified is hostile, that includes you right now"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=raider,outlaw|st=friendly,neutral",{"Raiders? {g:Buddy|Lady}, you're talking to one, relax, we're off the clock"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral|world=water",{"Watch the bikers by the river, they'll trade with you in the morning and rob you that night"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral",{"The city boys, kids with guns and nothing to lose - we keep our distance, you should too"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"You're looking at 'em, genius"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"Raiders? Nah, we're the welcoming committee"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=raider,gang,prison|st=hostile",{"Who should you avoid? Us, bit late for that, though"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=fence,road",{"There's a crew works this road, I counted four, one of 'em carries a fence post"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=family|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"{group} come through on Sundays, that's why we don't cook on Sundays anymore","I could tell you what they did at the Pruitt place - you want that in your head?"},false,{[2]="ASK_RAIDERS"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|world=vehicle,road",{"The ones in the blue van, you see a blue van, get off the road entirely"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=rescue_clergy|st=neutral,friendly|hour=16,5",{"I won't call anybody evil, I will say don't be on Tanner Road after dark"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"Watch for anybody too friendly too fast, that's the tell, it's always the tell"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"We had names for some of 'em before, now they've got friends and no reason to stop"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Armed civilians in organized groups, that's the polite term and it ain't accurate"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=elite|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Anybody with a lookout posted high has a plan, plans are what get people robbed"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=club|st=neutral",{"There's a crew out there pretending to be us - same jackets, we aim to fix that"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=civilian_loner|st=careful|mood=grim",{"Two kinds, ones that want your food, and ones that want your company - second's worse"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=raider,prison|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Dangerous people - yeah - well, you've found some, congratulations to you"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","reg=civilian,worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"There's more to it - you want the whole list, or just enough to stay clear?"},false,{[1]="ASK_RAIDERS"}},
{"ASK_RAIDERS","role=law_deputy|st=neutral|world=cars",{"I've kept a list, names, vehicles, days - you want to hear it read out?"},false,{[1]="ASK_RAIDERS"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Real? is this real? I keep pinching myself, I keep thinking I'll wake up in my own bed","It feels like a dream, a long, awful dream, with no waking up","I wish it weren't... but it is -- it's real, it's too real, I can smell it","Yes, it's real, and no, there's no one to tell you otherwise, I've tried!","I thought I was dreaming for the first two days... then I got hungry, and dreams don't make you hungry!!"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"It's real, kid, it's as real as the dirt under your nails...","Pinch yourself, if you like, it'll hurt, and you'll know","I dreamed it was a dream for a week -- then I stopped dreaming","Real as rain, real as taxes, real as the cold in your bones"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"It's real, but so are we, and that has to count for something"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Does it look like a dream to you?","Wake up and smell the smoke","I'm real, and so is this gun - stay back"}},
{"ASK_REAL","role=rescue_clergy",{"Reality is what we make of it... but this -- this is real, and God is real in it"}},
{"ASK_REAL","role=rescue_medical",{"It's real, I've got the bruises, the blood, and the paperwork to prove it"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Real? You think this is a dream? Pinch yourself, I'll wait","Hah! If it's a dream, it's a damn good one, I've got everything I ever wanted","It's real, {g:pal|lady}, as real as the gun in my hand, believe it","Sometimes I wonder, honestly, I keep expecting to wake up in my own bed"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Is it real? I'll show you how real it is!"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"I ask myself that every morning, honestly, and every morning it's real, and it hurts","God, I wish it wasn't, I wish I could wake up and go to work and have a boring day"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Man, I pinch myself every day, hoping to wake up in my bed","It's real, real as the scar on my arm","I keep thinking it's a movie, but the blood's too real"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I wish it was a dream, I really do, I'd give anything"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"It's real, {g:brother|sister}, as real as the road under my wheels","Some nights I wish it wasn't, other nights I wish it was a dream I could wake from"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=club|st=friendly",{"I keep waiting for my alarm clock, but it doesn't ring"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I'm afraid it is entirely real","Quite real, I regret to say"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I wish I could say otherwise"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"I thought I was dreaming when the walls came down, I'm still not sure","It's real, it's real, I touch things to be sure, I touch the ground, the trees"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Don't ask me that! Don't make me think about it!"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"Sometimes I think I'm still in my cell, dreaming of freedom"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Real as dirt, friend","It's real, and it doesn't get easier"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"I'd love for it to be a dream, believe me"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"I wish I could say no, but it's very real","It's real, and we have to deal with it"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=law|st=friendly",{"I asked myself the same thing, over and over, the answer is always the same"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"It's real, civilian, and we have a job to do"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=military|st=friendly",{"I wish it wasn't, honestly"}},
{"ASK_REAL","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"I keep hoping I'll wake up, but I never do, it's so real"}},
{"ASK_REAL","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Real as the sunrise, friend, and twice as stubborn"}},
{"ASK_REAL","role=militia|st=friendly",{"If it's a dream, the Lord's testing us, and we'll pass"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I keep asking myself that, I pinch my arm every morning, it's all bruises now - so, yes, I think it's real","It's real, I wish to God it wasn't - my sister's out there somewhere, walking around - it's real","Some mornings I wake up and for one second it's just a regular Tuesday - that second's the worst part of my day","Are YOU real? Oh God, okay - you're real, I've been talking to my own shadow for three days"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Real enough to bleed and real enough to bury, how's that for real","Dreams don't smell like this - believe me"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Want me to prove it? Take one more step"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=rescue|role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"You're awake, pupils look fine, you're in shock, which is about the most normal thing in this county"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"It's real, I've carried enough of it out of houses to know"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"It's real, got blisters from digging all week to prove it - dreams don't give you blisters"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"This is really happening, I need you to stay with me and stay calm - what's your name?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral",{"It's real, I've filled out incident reports on it, that's how you know something's real - it has paperwork"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"Real as this badge - keep your hands still"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=military|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I asked the sergeant the same thing, he rapped me on the helmet - it's real"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=military,elite|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Real as it gets, so eyes open"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Affirmative - it's real"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=military,elite|st=careful,hostile",{"It's real, and so is this perimeter - back away"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=outlaw,crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"If this is a dream, I want my money back - it's real","I've been drunk, high and in shock, and none of 'em looked like this - it's real"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=raider,gang,club,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Real? Want me to pinch you? Hahaha, with a knife","Real as it gets, this was always my world - everybody else just finally showed up"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful",{"You acting crazy to get close to me? Stop right there"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Real enough to kill you - want a demonstration?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I've asked myself that twice today, I think so - I hope so"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=family|st=neutral,friendly",{"I'm real, pinch your own arm, don't pinch mine, I've had a week"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"Real as this blister - wanna see it? No? Thought so"}},
{"ASK_REAL","role=rescue_medical|st=neutral,friendly",{"You're dried out and you haven't slept, that's what that feeling is"}},
{"ASK_REAL","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly",{"I'm here - you're here, whatever the rest of it is, that part's solid"}},
{"ASK_REAL","role=rescue_firefighter|st=neutral,friendly",{"It's real, I keep waiting to wake up too - eleven days of not waking up"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"It's real - I checked - Repeatedly, it kept on being real"}},
{"ASK_REAL","role=family_elder|st=friendly|mood=funny",{"Honey, if I was making this up I'd have made myself thirty years younger"}},
{"ASK_REAL","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"I'm real, the badge is real, the rest I've quit having opinions about"}},
{"ASK_REAL","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Affirmative - hold something with weight, a rifle, a canteen - that helps"}},
{"ASK_REAL","role=soldier_green|tmp=fresh|st=neutral",{"I asked my sergeant that, he hit me on the helmet, it helped, oddly enough"}},
{"ASK_REAL","role=elite_delta|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"You're awake, act like it"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=club|st=neutral|mood=funny|world=hot",{"I'm real, touch the pipe if you need proof, it's hot, so, maybe don't"}},
{"ASK_REAL","role=crime_member|st=neutral",{"Real enough to take your last can - does that settle it for you?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=raider,prison|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Oh, I'm real, you'll be real sure about that here in a minute"}},
{"ASK_REAL","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=careful,hostile",{"Don't, don't start that, you start and I'll start and neither of us comes back"}},
{"ASK_REMEDY","",{"Not really - rest, I guess","Wish I had something, nothing left in the medicine cabinet","Hot tea if you can get it, that's about all","I'm no doctor"}},
{"ASK_REMEDY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Honey in hot water, lemon if you've got it","Garlic, tea, and a lot of sleep","Steam helps, salt water gargle, then just wait it out"},false,false,{[1]={{t="and rest",afterMs=3500}}}},
